THEORY Ex4Q3
IMPORT-THEORY Equality
IMPORT-THEORY Boolean
IMPORT-THEORY Arithmetic
IMPORT-THEORY List
IMPORT-HASKELL List
IMPORT-HASKELL Ex4

THEOREM ex4q3

  c0ompute [] == 2 + 17*(len []) + sum []

STRATEGY ReduceAll

  c0ompute [] == 2 + 17*(len []) + sum []
  = DEF c0ompute.1
  2 == 2 + 17*(len []) + sum []
  = DEF len.1 @ len
  2 == 2 + 17*0 + sum []
  = DEF sum.1 @ sum
  2 == 2 + 17*0 + 0
  = SIMP
  True

END ReduceAll

QED ex4q3

